, casual gamers, and those who are here just for the untimely funny moments together. In Holdfast, your most powerful weapon isn't your musket, <strong>it's your voice</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The great Holdfast community welcomes you. \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589290/extras/eb3b0c3209b21dbaa7eebfca0e12e987.poster.avif?t=1773786476\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589290/extras/eb3b0c3209b21dbaa7eebfca0e12e987.webm?t=1773786476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589290/extras/eb3b0c3209b21dbaa7eebfca0e12e987.mp4?t=1773786476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589290/extras/8e058f1d7b116bfcbcbd9c6a77f11e1a.webp?t=1773786476\" width=620 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in large-scale battles across multiple eras! Ram your shot and fire impressive displays of coordinated volleys in the Napoleonic Wars or take to the frontlines of WW1 and charge at the officer's whistle to death or victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark aboard warships from the golden age of sail and take to the seven seas. Bombard the beaches of historic Gallipoli with the mighty dreadnought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589290/extras/5b94800e8a43a4b3288159e08d713896.poster.avif?t=1773786476\" width=800 he